I have a fairly major gripe about how out of hand one's AC can get in this
game.  Although I have yet to completely win, I've had two friends playing
completely legitimately who were both able to win simply do to their INSANE
AC ratings.  It seems once you get past about -20 or so NOTHING can even hope
to touch you!  I desperately plead that either a cap be put on the effective
AC ratings (not AD&D's -10 but maybe -20 or so) or beef a few of the crea-
tures so that it would take more than a super AC and Magic Resistance to
guaruntee success.  As I found out, who cares what weapon you've got if
you can't be hit.

  


